"Now we must use the courage we brought to Oleshky to find common ground through a shared concern for the suffering of innocent people." ❤️

@FLOTUS Melania Trump unites Russia and Ukraine following the historic ceasefire that she brokered in Oleshky.

It's the first time in American history that a First Lady has brought representatives of two nations actively at war together to the White House for diplomacy.
